sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as App startup (Ch 45)
    participant Cfg as Remote config (Ch 41)
    participant UM as UpdateManager
    participant Play as Play In-App Updates
    participant Store as Play Store listing

    App->>Cfg: fetch version policy (cached)
    Cfg-->>App: minSupported=120, latest=130
    App->>UM: evaluate(installed=110)
    UM-->>App: ForcedUpgrade
    App->>Play: appUpdateInfo (immediate allowed?)
    alt available from Play
        Play-->>App: available -> startImmediate (blocking)
    else not available (staged/not Play)
        UM->>Store: open listing (fallback)
    end
    User->>App: update + restart
    App->>UM: re-evaluate(installed=130) -> UpToDate (no loop)
